      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIG BOY ZULU (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 20.04 beating Hara's Usain. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. RITZA RINGER (7) is having his first start around this track. Comes here a last start placegetter at Q Lakeside in a Grade 5 (30.60). Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Hard to beat again. LESTER BANNER (8) was always well back but did hit the line strongly late to finish 4th and beaten only 5 lengths (19.96) at this track. Great chance to atone. UNCLE JOE (2) is among the chances again if he runs up to the latest effort.",
